      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "### The problem\n\nMy calendar includes a calendar that exposed only free/busy to me. I used to can get the info from that calendar. But I can't get the info since 2022/12/2 which is the last day my related automation triggered. Please help re-enable display the info of only exposed free/busy readers, many thanks!\n\n### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?\n\n2022.12.8\n\n### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?\n\n_No response_\n\n### What type of installation are you running?\n\nHome Assistant OS\n\n### Integration causing the issue\n\nGoogle Calendar\n\n### Link to integration documentation on our website\n\nhttps://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/google/\n\n### Diagnostics information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Example YAML snippet\n\n_No response_\n\n### Anything in the logs that might be useful for us?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
